# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession draft Leatherworking --out` from Forever's client tables. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/leatherworking
title Leatherworking 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# Data:
# The Forever client's tables (recipes, skill thresholds, reagents, vendor
# prices) via wago.tools, with Classic Era filling the few spells and items
# they lack; pfQuest (vendors, drops, nodes) and a curated trainer list
# checked against npcs.json. Forever changed many thresholds, reagents and
# names from Classic, so Classic recipe tables do not apply.
#
# Trainers and vendors are smart targets: the engine sends each character to
# the nearest one of its faction. Farming spots are picked per faction.
#
# Recipe choice: cheapest expected cost to 300 (Classic skill-up chances:
# certain while orange, falling from yellow to grey), with gathered materials
# valued at 4x their vendor sell price; see tools/lib/professions/plan.js.
# Material counts are expected values; yellow and green crafts can take more.
#
# Route:
#     1-55  Light Armor Kit (about 81)
#    55-75  Small Leather Ammo Pouch (about 32)
#    75-85  Embossed Leather Gloves (about 15)
#    85-105 Fine Leather Belt (about 32)
#   105-120 Light Leather Pants (about 27)
#   120-130 Nimble Leather Gloves (about 13)
#   130-150 Hillman's Shoulders (about 39)
#   150-170 Mystic Heavy Armor Kit (about 32)
#   170-175 Barbaric Shoulders (about 6)
#   175-185 Green Leather Bracers (about 14)
#   185-195 Guardian Gloves (about 14)
#   195-220 Forceful Thick Armor Kit (about 37)
#   220-225 Thick Leather Ammo Pouch (about 6)
#   225-236 Rugged Armor Kit (about 16)
#   236-267 Wicked Leather Gauntlets (about 37)
#   267-300 Runic Leather Headband (about 45)

step Apprentice Leatherworking
  tip Leatherworking runs alongside leveling. Forever's Legacy System rewards crafting professions at skill 150, 225 and 300 (the Journeyman, Expert and Artisan caps), so each of those checkpoints counts. Materials for 1-75 are worth about 1g 18s in all.
  train Leatherworking Apprentice
  skill Leatherworking 1
  buy 2320 x128 nearest

step Light Leather (Alliance)
  only Alliance
  zone Dun Morogh
  tip Skin Crag Boar, Elder Crag Boar, Ice Claw Bear, Juvenile Snow Leopard, Large Crag Boar, Scarred Crag Boar, Snow Leopard, Snow Tracker Wolf, Winter Wolf, Young Black Bear here (beasts of level 5-20 yield it); the Skinning guide routes this. The Auction House works too.
  collect 2318 x177 @32.7,57.1 era

